    "frontend_changed": true,
    "scope": "App 1.5.5 monitor: evaluate() accepts and ignores a check kind it does not know instead of returning report_invalid for all three components, and both known checks certificate and telnet remain required, so a report missing either stays report_invalid. No current report changes its verdict; status schema, reason codes, report format, state format, capture and normalize are unchanged. The release otherwise adds documentation only: none of the monitor's three components can see a controller that has left the relay's broker; 1x Heizen and 1x Absenken end silently when the firmware returns the circuit to Auto, with no end time derived from the unsynchronised controller clock; the one-time charge trigger's 0 report is its own reset, not completion and not a rejection; and the 60 s/3600 s telemetry cadence is a controller default a cloud setter can change. No entity, acknowledgement write or countdown was added. The frontend module differs from 1.4.13 only in its version constant and header comment."
